# Emscripten build outputs — intentionally NOT tracked (large binaries bloat the
# git history). Rebuild with `make` (see README.md) or copy the prebuilt files
# from a machine that has them. gmsh.{js,wasm} in particular needs OpenCASCADE
# cross-compiled to WASM, so it is distributed out-of-band rather than via git.
#
# Anchored to this directory so submodule build artifacts are unaffected.
/solver.js
/solver.wasm
/eigen_solver.js
/eigen_solver.wasm
/gmsh.js
/gmsh.wasm
